OL,5,G0100 Quincy Jones: Forty Thousand Years
OL,6,G     of Funk
OL,7,     FThis two-part documentary explores
OL,8,     Fthe origins and legacy of music
OL,9,     Findustry heavyweight Quincy Jones.
OL,10,G0200 Quincy Jones at the BBC
OL,11,     FA tribute to the master musician,
OL,12,     Fcomposer, arranger, film and music
OL,13,     Fproducer, we hear BBC interviews
OL,14,     Fcovering his life and career,
OL,15,     Fespecially work with Sinatra and
OL,16,     FMichael Jackson.
